        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Total tax: 52,402 koku 6 to 9 shō 7 gō. Opens the red-ink bracket that the note to its right flags. It is the sum of the two tax lines printed on the preceding page (p. 113): regular land tax 正租米 51,221.906 koku plus miscellaneous tax 雜税米 1,180.791 koku. The three components printed to its left sum to 51,221.906 koku, matching the 正租米 line exactly."
